'''Togedemaru''' (Japanese: '''トゲデマル''' ''Togedemaru'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

